# Proposed features recognized from boss_chamfer.step by sidecar/import_step.py
# (contract v1 -- see sidecar/CONTRACT.md). Review before use:
# recognition proposes, it does not machine.

# F1: outer profile under top cap F3: vertical wall loop F1 F2 F6 F4, top at z=10.0, base at z=0.0, material inside the loop (CHECKLIST row 2.2)
# consume with: run Side(tool=..., surface=F1_Profile, comp=control)  [the feature carries its own z + extent]
# the loop is wound CW: material inside, tool outside (the winding convention,
# DECISIONS.md -> "Row-2.4 side selector")
# comp=control is required on Contour runs: recognized boundaries carry rounded
# corners tessellated to chords, and engine comp hard-errors on rounded-corner
# offsets (DECISIONS.md -> "recognized contours propose comp=control")
feature F1_Profile ProfileBoss(z=18.0, extent=18.0
    0.0 0.0
    0.0 40.0
    40.0 40.0
    40.0 0.0
)

